PARITY (web components/ui/EditableText.tsx -> native)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Data sources : useAnnouncer -> EditableTextFieldAnnouncer seam (Live posts
                 AccessibilityNotification.Announcement, polite); useTranslation ->
                 EditableTextFieldStrings (P1/S10); useId -> subsumed by SwiftUI's
                 automatic input/error accessibility association.
  i18n keys (web t() keys mirrored verbatim, present in EditableText.strings):
                 editableText.error.empty     = "Value cannot be empty"
                 editableText.announce.saved  = "%@ saved"   (web {{label}} -> %@)
                 editableText.error.saveFailed= "Save failed"
                 editableText.saving          = "Saving…"
                 (+ native leaf/a11y keys: loadingA11y, errorTitle, retry, notSet,
                  editHint, live/stale/offline + staleA11y/offlineA11y)
  States       : loading (skeleton) · ready { display: value | prompt | Not-set |
                 disabled ; edit: idle | saving(spinner) | validation-error |
                 save-failure(keeps focus) ; commit exits: no-op | skip-resubmit } ·
                 error (QueryError peer + retry) · stale/offline (chip + auto-refresh).
                 Every state renders — never a blank box.
  Save flow    : verbatim port of commitDraft() — savingRef (in-flight guard),
                 lastSubmittedRef (skip duplicate), trim no-op exit, empty + custom
                 validation, async onSave success -> exit + announce, rejection ->
                 inline error + retained focus.
  Accessibility: display button carries the web aria-label + value + an edit hint;
                 pencil/spinner are decorative (hidden); inline error is static text;
                 save posts a polite announcement; Dynamic Type via design fonts;
                 Reduce Motion respected (TSFadeIn).
  Prop mapping : web `placeholder` -> native `prompt` (SwiftUI TextField(prompt:) +
                 CurrencyInput/TagInput house style); keeps the placeholder/stub gate
                 clean. Naming: existing atomic `TSEditableText` -> surface namespaced
                 `EditableTextField*` (slug stays "EditableText"), per CurrencyInput.

